unities to flex their muscle to really demonstrate our value proposition in terms of understanding the business and finding optimal solutions for existing…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/18/east-west-bancorp-inc-ewbc-q3-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"EWBC 2018 Q4","e":"ewbc","d":"2019-01-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Dominic Ng","x":"What you can see, 2018, if you look at what should be listed up the top 10 news in any kind of media or magazine, the trade war will probably front and center at the top.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/24/east-west-bancorp-inc-ewbc-q4-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"EWBC 2018 Q4","e":"ewbc","d":"2019-01-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Dominic Ng","x":"And interesting enough, we -- while we presented the East West's exposure to tariffs two quarters in a row, but at the end of the day comes the end of the year, we actually grew our trade portfolio by 7% year-over-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/24/east-west-bancorp-inc-ewbc-q4-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"EWBC 2019 Q2","e":"ewbc","d":"2019-07-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Dominic Ng","x":"Over the past 12 months, tariffs and trade tensions have ratcheted up, yet East West has delivered attractive loan and deposit growth, as well as attractive bottom line profitability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/18/east-west-bancorp-inc-ewbc-q2-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"EWBC 2019 Q2","e":"ewbc","d":"2019-07-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Dominic Ng","x":"I think if you look at the last 12 months, this sort of tariff rhetorics and discussion in terms of media headlines has been going on for quite some time now, and we continue to be able to put out these numbers, because we have multiple engines that we can get going.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/18/east-west-bancorp-inc-ewbc-q2-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"EWBC 2019 Q3","e":"ewbc","d":"2019-10-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Dominic Ng","x":"We're looking at, for example the Trump administration have just gotten WTO approval of imposing 100% tariff against certain imports coming from Europe.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/17/east-west-bancorp-inc-ewbc-q3-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"EWBC 2019 Q3","e":"ewbc","d":"2019-10-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Dominic Ng","x":"We still have not signed the North America Free Trade treaty with Canada and Mexico, and we're supposed to, on December 15, to impose tariff on $550 billions of import coming from China.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/17/east-west-bancorp-inc-ewbc-q3-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"EWBC 2019 Q4","e":"ewbc","d":"2020-01-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Dominic Ng","x":"Over the course of the past two years, where we could, we actively reduced credit exposures, particularly to customers with higher direct or indirect tariff-related credit risks, largely concentrated in the wholesale trade and manufacturing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/23/east-west-bancorp-inc-ewbc-q4-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"EWBC 2019 Q4","e":"ewbc","d":"2020-01-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Dominic Ng","x":"Importantly, we have experienced only one charge-off related trade tariffs and it was less than $1 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/23/east-west-bancorp-inc-ewbc-q4-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"EWBC 2019 Q4","e":"ewbc","d":"2020-01-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dominic Ng","x":"…or just passed right through to US consumers and US consumers also seem to be taking those pass-through very nicely as we've seen in the retail report for the fourth quarter so far. So all in all, I see that there will be a little bit more normalization of trade activities going on in…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/23/east-west-bancorp-inc-ewbc-q4-2019-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"EWBC 2020 Q1","e":"ewbc","d":"2020-04-23","l":"theater","r":"analyst","s":"Ebrahim Poonawala","x":"When we first started eight, nine years ago, many of our entertainment loans were for theatrical release production financing, well-collateralized rights, foreign distribution rights, tax credit, and so forth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/east-west-bancorp-inc-ewbc-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"EWBC 2020 Q1","e":"ewbc","d":"2020-04-23","l":"theater","r":"analyst","s":"Ebrahim Poonawala","x":"We have no exposure to theaters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/east-west-bancorp-inc-ewbc-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"EWBC 2020 Q1","e":"ewbc","d":"2020-04-23","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Ebrahim Poonawala","x":"Today, most of our lending when it comes to content development production, are for streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/east-west-bancorp-inc-ewbc-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"EWBC 2020 Q1","e":"ewbc","d":"2020-04-23","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Ebrahim Poonawala","x":"It goes to Netflix, to Amazon, Apple, etc. In fact, our entertainment lending in China predominantly to stream a television production and Internet streaming companies contract and so forth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/east-west-bancorp-inc-ewbc-q1-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"EWBC 2020 Q2","e":"ewbc","d":"2020-07-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Dominic Ng","x":"But what you have seen so far for the last two or three years, whether in China on the tariff situation, East West navigate through the last three years with this heavy U.S.-China political bash regarding to tariff and somehow we navigate through and have very minimal losses and continue to be…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/east-west-bancorp-inc-ewbc-q2-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"EWBC 2020 Q2","e":"ewbc","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jared Shaw","x":"Should we assume that those just stay on sort of a continued deferral that's allowed under the CARES Act or would you expect to see more of an active restructuring of the most troubled loans before year-end and try to get them on to a new system or a new structure?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/east-west-bancorp-inc-ewbc-q2-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"EWBC 2020 Q3","e":"ewbc","d":"2020-10-22","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Dominic Ng","x":"Many of my colleagues in Shanghai and Shenzhen, they go out to movie theaters, having dinner with their friends, don't even have to wear mask.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/east-west-bancorp-inc-ewbc-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"EWBC 2020 Q3","e":"ewbc","d":"2020-10-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Dominic Ng","x":"And we looked at -- even with the trade war in place for the last few years with the tariff, as you have seen so far, we have such a big trade finance portfolio, import/export business and then also with Greater China exposure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/east-west-bancorp-inc-ewbc-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"EWBC 2020 Q4","e":"ewbc","d":"2021-01-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Irene H. Oh","x":"Yes, so the tariffs for CRE in the quarter, we -- obviously, especially with the pandemic in the environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/east-west-bancorp-inc-ewbc-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"EWBC 2021 Q2","e":"ewbc","d":"2021-07-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Dominic Ng","x":"Under the Trump administration, there are a lot of -- not only just reverts [Phonetic] but also the enforcement of tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/