","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/23/east-west-ewbc-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EWBC 2025 Q3","e":"ewbc","d":"2025-10-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Dominic Ng","x":"And then maybe looking at some of the tariff-related impact, we are hearing from some others that you are starting to see a little bit of relief there and there is third-quarter loan growth as clarity increases in some cases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/22/east-west-ewbc-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EWBC 2025 Q3","e":"ewbc","d":"2025-10-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Dominic Ng","x":"Or is this really still an opportunity maybe we get a little bit more clarity on some of the tariffs that may be more impactful to your client base?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/22/east-west-ewbc-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EWBC 2026 Q1","e":"ewbc","d":"2026-04-21","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Jared Shaw","x":"Are you seeing any areas of stress there—maybe from tech worker disruption from AI—or anything that you are spending a little more time looking at?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/east-west-ewbc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EWBC 2026 Q1","e":"ewbc","d":"2026-04-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christopher Del Moral-Niles","x":"Given the level of net growth we saw in the first quarter, and the pipelines we see going into Q2, we are comfortable reiterating our guidance for full-year loan growth to be in the range of 5% to 7%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/east-west-ewbc-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EWBC 2026 Q1","e":"ewbc","d":"2026-04-21","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"David Chiaverini","x":"You alluded to higher-for-longer being good for East West Bancorp, Inc. Was this the main contributor to raising the guide, or was the loan outlook also part of it?","url":"ht